<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="emblems">Emblems of Triumph for Fire Mage DPS Phase 3</h3>This phase, the new emblem is called <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47241/emblem-of-triumph">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_summonchampion.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Emblem of Triumph</span></a>.  This will be mostly used to purchase the 232 or 245 item level version of Tier 9, however due to the currency cost being the same, and the limited acquisition rate, you should not buy the 232 version of the Tier.<br/>
<br/>The 245 item level tier 9 requires more emblems, but also one <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47242/trophy-of-the-crusade">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_trophy_argent.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Trophy of the Crusade</span></a> for any of the 5 items, these are obtainable in Heroic 10-man <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=4722/trial-of-the-crusader">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Trial of the Crusader</span></a> chest (two or four depending on your wipe threshold) and from the bosses of 25-man. Because you're capped on <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47241/emblem-of-triumph">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_summonchampion.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Emblem of Triumph</span></a>, the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47242/trophy-of-the-crusade">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_trophy_argent.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Trophy of the Crusade</span></a> will be spread out between all raiders instead of funneled onto one player.<br/>
