<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="body-armor">Body Armor for Fire Mage DPS Phase 3</h2>
<div data-manual-placement-group="guide-body-article-au" style="margin: auto; display: flex; justify-content: center; min-height: 90px;">
<div id="guide-body-article-au__ayManagerEnv__1"></div></div>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="head">Head for Fire Mage DPS Phase 3</h3>Coming from Phase 2, the 258 ilvl <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47764/sunstriders-hood-of-triumph">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_102.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sunstrider's Hood of Triumph</span></a> is best in slot, but might take a little while to obtain. There's not many meaningful options outside of Tier 9 since the 245 ilvl <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47771/sunstriders-hood-of-triumph">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_102.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sunstrider's Hood of Triumph</span></a> will be very easy to obtain and will provide a pretty big amount of Critical Strike with its set bonuses. These are the two only headpiece items you should go for. Outside of these, the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46129/conquerors-kirin-tor-hood">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_133.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Conqueror's Kirin Tor Hood</span></a> will still be acceptable early on since it can provide solid set bonuses and it's obtainable from both 10 and 25-man <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=4273/ulduar">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Ulduar</span></a>, as well as purchasable with <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/currency=221/emblem-of-conquest">
<span>
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_championsgrace.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Emblem of Conquest</span></span></a> which will drop from the new Heroic Dungeon Difficulty - making this the best early headpiece.<div class="quote-box" data-has-source="false" data-type="user">
<div class="quote-header"></div>
