<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="shoulders">Shoulders for Fire Mage DPS Phase 3</h3>Similarly to the Head slot, shoulders are somewhat basic choices. You should try and obtain the Tier 9 245ilvl <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47768/sunstriders-shoulderpads-of-triumph">
