<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_35.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sunstrider's Shoulderpads of Triumph</span></a> instead. Until Then you should use either <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46134/conquerors-kirin-tor-shoulderpads">
