<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="back">Back for Fire Mage DPS Phase 3</h3>WIthin the Cloak slot, there's the biggest power creep this phase, because we have access to 272ilvl options. These will be very rare and hard to get for even relatively high-end players due to needing to clear the entirety of Heroic <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=4722/trial-of-the-crusader">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Trial of the Crusader</span></a> without a single wipe. From 25-man you have access to <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47551/aethas-intensity">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_18.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Aethas' Intensity</span></a> which is our BiS, or <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47554/lady-liadrins-conviction">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_18.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Lady Liadrin's Conviction</span></a> which is about 20 dps worse. From 10-man you can obtain 258ilvl down-scaled and renamed versions of the same items with the same wipeless run requirement to obtain, and same dps difference, respectively the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=48666/drape-of-the-sunreavers">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_18.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Drape of the Sunreavers</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47452/shroud-of-displacement">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_18.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Shroud of Displacement</span></a>.<br/>
<br/>Outside of these rare cloaks, the best options continue to be the same as Phase 2, where <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45242/drape-of-mortal-downfall">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_13.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Drape of Mortal Downfall</span></a> is the best cloak assuming you need the Hit, or <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45618/sunglimmer-cloak">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_06.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sunglimmer Cloak</span></a> if you don't. With the same logic being applied to the 239ilvl cloaks, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46042/drape-of-the-messenger">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_06.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Drape of the Messenger</span></a> if you need Hit, or <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46321/sunglimmer-drape">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_06.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sunglimmer Drape</span></a> if you don't.<div class="quote-box" data-has-source="false" data-type="user">
<div class="quote-header"></div>
<div class="quote-body" data-markup-content-target="1">
