<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="chest">Chest for Fire Mage DPS Phase 3</h3>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47462/skyweaver-vestments">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_cloth_64.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Skyweaver Vestments</span></a> is the best in slot, but by a slim margin - this provides a lot of the required Hit for Fire Mage (TTW) and the best off-piece assuming you have four-piece tier 9 equipped on the other slots. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47425/flowing-robes-of-ascent">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_cloth_73.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Flowing Robes of Ascent</span></a> is best in slot for Frostfire because the specialization in itself requires less Hit, but this chestpiece can also be within range of <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47462/skyweaver-vestments">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_cloth_64.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Skyweaver Vestments</span></a> assuming you make up the hit using other items, such as <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47482/boots-of-the-icy-floe">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_cloth_17.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Boots of the Icy Floe</span></a> alongside a couple of <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40153/veiled-ametrine">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_gem_39.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Veiled Ametrine</span></a>, or <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47422/barb-of-tarasque">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_weapon_shortblade_93.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Barb of Tarasque</span></a> instead of <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47518/mortalis">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_sword_137.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mortalis</span></a> with some <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40153/veiled-ametrine">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_gem_39.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Veiled Ametrine</span></a> gems.<br/>
<br/>Lastly, there's the option of Tier 9. Assuming you're using the 258ilvl <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47766/sunstriders-robe-of-triumph">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_cloth_68.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sunstrider's Robe of Triumph</span></a> tier 9 which by itself is only approx. 110 dps difference, but when equipped with an off-piece on another slot such as <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45665/pharos-gloves">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_61.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Pharos Gloves</span></a>, it's only approx 60 dps.<div class="quote-box" data-has-source="false" data-type="user">
