<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="wrist">Wrist for Fire Mage DPS Phase 3</h3>In terms of bracers, there's two very good options, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47467/dark-essence-bindings">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_32a.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Dark Essence Bindings</span></a> assuming best in slot full set. But it's relevant to know that <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47485/bindings-of-the-ashen-saint">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_24b.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bindings of the Ashen Saint</span></a> are exactly as good for both Fire specializations assuming you can get similar amount of hit elsewhere, such as using <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47422/barb-of-tarasque">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_weapon_shortblade_93.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Barb of Tarasque</span></a> instead of <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47518/mortalis">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_sword_137.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mortalis</span></a> or <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47482/boots-of-the-icy-floe">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_cloth_17.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Boots of the Icy Floe</span></a> instead of <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47454/sandals-of-the-mourning-widow">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_cloth_23.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sandals of the Mourning Widow</span></a>. This applies especially for <span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/side_alliance.gif");'>Alliance</span> who need slightly less Hit than horde, and even more so for <span class="c8">
<span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/race_human_male.gif");'>Human Mages</span></span> since their racial provides extra spirit which gets boosted by tier 9 this phase.<br/>
<br/>The same that was said for <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47485/bindings-of-the-ashen-saint">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_24b.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bindings of the Ashen Saint</span></a> also applies to <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45446/grasps-of-reason">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_24b.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Grasps of Reason</span></a> since they're very similar, just slightly lower item level, these perform within very close range. Lastly, there's <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47586/bejeweled-wizards-bracers">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_32a.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bejeweled Wizard's Bracers</span></a> which now should be considered the baseline item for this slot since you can easily craft or get one crafted for you.<div class="quote-box" data-has-source="false" data-type="user">
