<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="hands">Hands for Fire Mage DPS Phase 3</h3>For the most part, you'll aim to use Tier 9 Gloves (ideally <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47763/sunstriders-gauntlets-of-triumph">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_56.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sunstrider's Gauntlets of Triumph</span></a> but temporarily <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47772/sunstriders-gauntlets-of-triumph">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_56.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sunstrider's Gauntlets of Triumph</span></a>). But assuming you obtain four-piece tier 9 through other slots, you can use an off-piece such as <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45665/pharos-gloves">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_61.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Pharos Gloves</span></a> here, these perform about 60 dps worse than the two chestpiece off-pieces but you might already have it since it was best in slot during Phase 2. Until then, you can use <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46132/conquerors-kirin-tor-gauntlets">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_17.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Conqueror's Kirin Tor Gauntlets</span></a> or <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46131/valorous-kirin-tor-gauntlets">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_17.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valorous Kirin Tor Gauntlets</span></a> assuming you're getting their set bonuses.<br/>
<br/>Note that while Tier 9 232 ilvl <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47773/sunstriders-gauntlets-of-conquest">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_56.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sunstrider's Gauntlets of Conquest</span></a> is listed here, and can be an upgrade, I personally recommend against purchasing it with <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47241/emblem-of-triumph">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_summonchampion.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Emblem of Triumph</span></a>. Buying this will delay purchashing the 245 ilvl version of the same item. Only use this if it's free from <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=4603/vault-of-archavon">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Vault of Archavon</span></a>.<div class="quote-box" data-has-source="false" data-type="user">
<div class="quote-header"></div>
<div class="quote-body" data-markup-content-target="1">
<b>Recommended BiS Glove Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=54999/hyperspeed-accelerators">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Hyperspeed Accelerators</span></a> if you're an <span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif");'>Engineer</span>, otherwise use <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=44592/enchant-gloves-exceptional-spellpower">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Gloves - Exceptional Spellpower</span></a>.<br/>
<span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif");'>Engineering</span> is highly recommended as a <span class="c8">
<span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/class_mage.gif");'>Mage</span></span> profession.</div></div>
