<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="waist">Waist for Fire Mage DPS Phase 3</h3>Two options here, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47447/belt-of-biting-cold">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_52.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Belt of Biting Cold</span></a> should be the baseline assuming you need the hit it provides, otherwise you should use <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47419/belt-of-the-tenebrous-mist">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_52.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Belt of the Tenebrous Mist</span></a>. These perform about the same, but the first should be somewhat less contested. Until then, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45619/starwatchers-binding">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_46.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Starwatcher's Binding</span></a> is fine since it's only between 30-40 dps worse than the latter. If you need Hit but don't yet have the best in slot, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47994/icehowl-binding">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_52.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Icehowl Binding</span></a> is the best option before 25-Man Heroic, and before that you can get an easy <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45557/sash-of-ancient-power">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_10.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sash of Ancient Power</span></a> BoE to help with your Hit issues in early-mid stages of gearing.<div class="quote-box" data-has-source="false" data-type="user">
<div class="quote-header"></div>
<div class="quote-body" data-markup-content-target="1">
