<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="legs">Legs for Fire Mage DPS Phase 3</h3>Aim to use Tier 9 for the legs slot, ideally <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47765/sunstriders-leggings-of-triumph">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_cloth_20.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sunstrider's Leggings of Triumph</span></a>, but temporarily you will likely use <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47770/sunstriders-leggings-of-triumph">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_cloth_20.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sunstrider's Leggings of Triumph</span></a> until then. While there's some options for off-pieces here, they're just not as strong as other slots such as chest or gloves. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47435/pants-of-the-soothing-touch">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_cloth_06.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Pants of the Soothing Touch</span></a> for example can provide a lot of stats, but will require other Hit items such as <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47482/boots-of-the-icy-floe">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_cloth_17.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Boots of the Icy Floe</span></a> or <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47422/barb-of-tarasque">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_weapon_shortblade_93.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Barb of Tarasque</span></a> - and even then it's still approx 90 dps weaker than either of the chest options, or 30 dps weaker than <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45665/pharos-gloves">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_61.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Pharos Gloves</span></a>. The same applies for <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47478/breeches-of-the-deepening-void">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_cloth_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Breeches of the Deepening Void</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45488/leggings-of-the-enslaved-idol">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_cloth_27.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Leggings of the Enslaved Idol</span></a> , which do provide hit, meaning you can then drop some hit on slots such as off-hand or waist, but it'll still be weaker than other off-pieces assuming you have four-piece tier 9 equipped elsewhere. Until then feel free to use Tier 8 for good early set bonuses.<br/>
<br/>Note that while Tier 9 232 ilvl <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47775/sunstriders-leggings-of-conquest">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_cloth_20.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sunstrider's Leggings of Conquest</span></a> is listed here, and can be an upgrade, I personally recommend against purchasing it with <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47241/emblem-of-triumph">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_summonchampion.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Emblem of Triumph</span></a>. Buying this will delay purchashing the 245 ilvl version of the same item. Only use this if it's free from <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=4603/vault-of-archavon">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Vault of Archavon</span></a>.<div class="quote-box" data-has-source="false" data-type="user">
<div class="quote-header"></div>
