<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="feet">Feet for Fire Mage DPS Phase 3</h3>There's four categories of items here which in pairs perform the same but serve different roles:<br/>
<br/>These two are the best in slot and perform exactly the same:<ul>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47454/sandals-of-the-mourning-widow">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_cloth_23.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sandals of the Mourning Widow</span></a> should be assuming you're already hit capped, and serves as the base in most sets.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47482/boots-of-the-icy-floe">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_cloth_17.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Boots of the Icy Floe</span></a> is one of the best options for filling in Hit, assuming you're dropping some from other slots such as chest, weapons, or waist.</div></li></ul>Until then, the options from <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=4273/ulduar">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Ulduar</span></a> continue to perform the very well, although the gap between them increased:<ul>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45135/boots-of-fiery-resolution">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_cloth_19.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Boots of Fiery Resolution</span></a> are 30 dps worse than <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47454/sandals-of-the-mourning-widow">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_cloth_23.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sandals of the Mourning Widow</span></a>.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45537/treads-of-the-false-oracle">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_cloth_17.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Treads of the False Oracle</span></a> are 70 dps worse than <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47454/sandals-of-the-mourning-widow">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_cloth_23.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sandals of the Mourning Widow</span></a>.</div></li></ul>From 10-man <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=4722/trial-of-the-crusader">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Trial of the Crusader</span></a>, these two items are similar to the first two, but perform about 140 dps worse:<ul>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47940/sandals-of-the-silver-magus">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_cloth_17.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sandals of the Silver Magus</span></a> if you need hit.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=49234/boots-of-the-grieving-soul">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_cloth_23.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Boots of the Grieving Soul</span></a> if you're already hit capped.</div></li></ul>Lastly, these two should be considered the bare minimum for any raiding character, they're very easy to obtain:<ul>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45566/spellslingers-slippers">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_cloth_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Spellslinger's Slippers</span></a> very easy to obtain, this should be the bare minimum in this slot before any raid.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46050/starlight-treads">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_cloth_21.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Starlight Treads</span></a> slightly harder to obtain but performs similarly anyways.</div></li></ul>
