<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="jewelry">Jewelry for Fire Mage DPS Phase 3</h2>
<div class="pad"></div>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="neck">Neck for Fire Mage DPS Phase 3</h3>By far the neck slot sees the least new items, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47468/cry-of-the-valkyr">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_36.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cry of the Val'kyr</span></a> is the new best in slot, that's the only upgrade. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45133/pendant-of-fiery-havoc">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_31.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Pendant of Fiery Havoc</span></a> will now be the second best necklace, performing at around 40 dps less than <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47468/cry-of-the-valkyr">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_36.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cry of the Val'kyr</span></a> — assuming you can drop hit on other slots, for example, swapping <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47437/talisman-of-heedless-sins">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_offhand_stratholme_a_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Talisman of Heedless Sins</span></a> for <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47470/mystifying-charm">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_offhand_stratholme_a_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mystifying Charm</span></a> combined with one <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40153/veiled-ametrine">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_gem_39.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Veiled Ametrine</span></a> to help fill the gap. Similarly, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=48030/darkbane-amulet">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_46.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Darkbane Amulet</span></a> fulfills the same role, but might require a bit more hit — this neck performs 90 dps worse than BiS in best case scenario.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45243/sapphire-amulet-of-renewal">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_30naxxramas.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sapphire Amulet of Renewal</span></a> doesn't provide any hit, which can make gearing towards <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47468/cry-of-the-valkyr">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_36.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cry of the Val'kyr</span></a> more stress-free, this neck performs approx 70 dps worse than <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47468/cry-of-the-valkyr">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_36.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cry of the Val'kyr</span></a>. Lastly, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45933/pendant-of-the-shallow-grave">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_46.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Pendant of the Shallow Grave</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45447/watchful-eye-of-fate">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_45.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Watchful Eye of Fate</span></a> are close behind at a 80 dps differential.<div class="pad"></div>
