<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="trinkets">Trinkets for Fire Mage DPS Phase 3</h3>Similarly to the rings, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45518/flare-of-the-heavens">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_summonlightwell.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Flare of the Heavens</span></a> from Phase 2 will continue to be best in slot. Combined with it you should aim to use <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47477/reign-of-the-dead">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_crown_13.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Reign of the Dead</span></a> which is an upgrade of anywhere from 200 to 290 dps from <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45466/scale-of-fates">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_spiritshard_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Scale of Fates</span></a> depending on the fight length.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45466/scale-of-fates">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_spiritshard_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Scale of Fates</span></a> is still third best, but it has the flaw of performing somewhat worse in many fight lengths where it gets poor value, such as two minute fights, where it's on the very edge of getting another use if the fight were two minutes and twenty seconds. In these low value fight lengths for <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45466/scale-of-fates">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_spiritshard_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Scale of Fates</span></a>, the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45308/eye-of-the-broodmother">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_eye_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Eye of the Broodmother</span></a> trinket can often outperform by a small margin. These two trinkets are both easier to obtain now, from 10-man <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=4273/ulduar">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Ulduar</span></a> and Heroic Defense Protocol BETA dungeons respectively.  <br/>
<br/>Lastly, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45148/living-flame">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_fire_burnout.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Living Flame</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40255/dying-curse">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_trinket_naxxramas03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Dying Curse</span></a> are still quality trinkets assuming you're in urgent need of hit, the former suffers from same issues I previously mentioned with <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45466/scale-of-fates">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_spiritshard_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Scale of Fates</span></a>, but they're both worthwhile getting during early and mid stages of gearing.<div class="pad"></div>
