<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="off-hand-weapons-for-fire-mage-dps-phase-3">Off Hand Weapons for Fire Mage DPS Phase 3</h4>This phase there's three new equally great options for Off-hands:<ul>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47437/talisman-of-heedless-sins">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_offhand_stratholme_a_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Talisman of Heedless Sins</span></a>, if you need hit to get capped with, this is best in situations such as the main set at the top of this guide.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47470/mystifying-charm">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_offhand_stratholme_a_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mystifying Charm</span></a>, if you're already hit capped through the use of items such as <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47422/barb-of-tarasque">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_weapon_shortblade_93.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Barb of Tarasque</span></a>, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47482/boots-of-the-icy-floe">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_cloth_17.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Boots of the Icy Floe</span></a>, or <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47447/belt-of-biting-cold">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_52.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Belt of Biting Cold</span></a> instead of their non-hit alternatives.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=48032/lightbane-focus">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_offhand_stratholme_a_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Lightbane Focus</span></a>, in some niche scenarios for Alliance, such as using <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47482/boots-of-the-icy-floe">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_cloth_17.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Boots of the Icy Floe</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47425/flowing-robes-of-ascent">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_cloth_73.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Flowing Robes of Ascent</span></a> instead of <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47454/sandals-of-the-mourning-widow">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_cloth_23.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sandals of the Mourning Widow</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47462/skyweaver-vestments">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_cloth_64.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Skyweaver Vestments</span></a> to drop a small amount of hit, which when combined with Alliance's Draenei group racial <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=6562/heroic-presence">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_21.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Heroic Presence</span></a> and a <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40153/veiled-ametrine">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_gem_39.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Veiled Ametrine</span></a> performs similarly to swapping from <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45294/petrified-ivy-sprig">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_wand_29.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Petrified Ivy Sprig</span></a> to <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47922/rod-of-imprisoned-souls">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_wand_15.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Rod of Imprisoned Souls</span></a>.</div></li></ul>Even with all these new options, last phase's best in slot off hand <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45617/cosmos">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_offhand_ulduarraid_d_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cosmos</span></a> keeps up, performing only 30 dps worse than <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47437/talisman-of-heedless-sins">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_offhand_stratholme_a_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Talisman of Heedless Sins</span></a>. Lastly, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45115/leviathan-fueling-manual">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_offhand_ulduarraid_d_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Leviathan Fueling Manual</span></a> achieves 130 dps less than the best off hands these phase, but is significantly easier to obtain from 10-man <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45115/leviathan-fueling-manual">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_offhand_ulduarraid_d_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Leviathan Fueling Manual</span></a>.<div class="pad"></div>
